{"seq":2,"slug":"tesla-success","title":"特斯拉的成功","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/major-works/tesla-success","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"from-roadster-to-model-3","title":"从 Roadster 到 Model 3","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/major-works/tesla-success/from-roadster-to-model-3","wordCount":1418,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-ev-revolution","title":"电动车革命","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/major-works/tesla-success/the-ev-revolution","wordCount":1389,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 特斯拉的成功\n\n马斯克对汽车产业的代表成就，凝结于特斯拉从高端到大众的产品演进与其引发的产业变革。本章考察这一成功。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"从 Roadster 到 Model 3\"——这条由高到低、逐步走量的路线如何让电动车走向大众。第二篇文档讲述\"电动车革命\",揭示特斯拉如何撬动百年汽车工业的全面电动化转型。\n"}